  "rt-thank-you-html": "\n                    <h2>Your white paper is available 👇</h2>\n                    <h2>Boost your restaurant like BChef!</h2>\n                    <p><strong>Thank you!</strong></p>\n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://5696087.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5696087/Livres%20blancs/Boostez%20votre%20franchise%20comme%20BCHEF.pdf\">Download</a></p>\n                    <p>Thank you <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/en\">Innovorder</a> team</p>\n                  ",
  "rt-ebook-html": "\n              <p>Julien Perret, <strong>founder of BCHEF</strong>, shares his vision on the <strong>digitalization</strong> of fast food franchises in France.</p>\n            ",
  "temoignage-img-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/642de52943894ea292355396_logo%20bchef%201.avif",
  "temoignage-img-class": "temoignage-img",
  "icon-ebook-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6496c09ebbeb019764e0a0ce_Picto%20euro.avif",
  "icon-ebook-sizes": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html": "\n            <p>How Stephanie<strong> increased her average shopping cart by 30%</strong> and her order volume by 13%.</p>\n          ",
  "icon-ebook-src-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6496c0cad63c5d39f97ed12c_Picto%20horloge.avif",
  "icon-ebook-sizes-2": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset-2": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-2": "\n            <p>How Peggy <strong>saves 30 minutes</strong> a day on opening and closing her register.</p>\n          ",
  "icon-ebook-src-3": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6496c0d394873c8b56360c17_Picto%20fus%C3%A9e%201.avif",
  "icon-ebook-sizes-3": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset-3": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-3": "\n            <p>How Damien <strong>serves his customers in 6 minutes</strong> and why he is convinced by digital.</p>\n          ",
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-4": "\n          <p>Digital is an essential lever to develop the activity of its franchise and to manage its restaurants. <strong>BCHEF </strong>unveils its proven strategy in exclusivity. </p>\n          <p>Take advantage of their best advice now!</p>\n        "
 }
